category: Libs
requires: libcharls2 pkg-config
sdesc: "C++ JPEG-LS library implementation (development)"
ldesc: "CharLS is a C++ implementation of the JPEG-LS standard for lossless and
near-lossless image compression and decompression. JPEG-LS is a low-complexity
image compression standard that matches JPEG 2000 compression ratios."
external-source: charls

